{"4252340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CPM 2", "steam_appid": 4252340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/cbfb4c68eb9034f0b1ced8249a64b501.poster.avif?t=1786694345\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/cbfb4c68eb9034f0b1ced8249a64b501.webm?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/cbfb4c68eb9034f0b1ced8249a64b501.mp4?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Parking Multiplayer 2</strong> is the ultimate car sandbox and auto-life simulator, bringing together a massive car meet culture and legal motorsport. Explore a massive open world, customize cars beyond recognition, and compete with thousands of real players thanks to full crossplay support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features of the game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/661a7fabf77f19280d78b75a352101a0.poster.avif?t=1786694345\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/661a7fabf77f19280d78b75a352101a0.webm?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/661a7fabf77f19280d78b75a352101a0.mp4?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full crossplay and a living world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst into a unified ecosystem! The PC version offers <strong>full cross-platform play</strong> with mobile devices. The game servers are always full: communicate via built-in voice chat, organize car meets, pull into gas stations and auto shops, add like-minded people to your friends list, and trade cars right on the city streets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Car hangouts and customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/c177cbd91539b0bd8417f980d8b00663.poster.avif?t=1786694345\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/c177cbd91539b0bd8417f980d8b00663.webm?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/c177cbd91539b0bd8417f980d8b00663.mp4?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your car unique:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interior and detailing:</strong> Every car has a fully detailed cabin and interior. Some models have multiple interior options available, and sports cars will surprise you with animated retractable panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep tuning:</strong> Adjust suspension and wheel camber. Perform full engine, turbocharger, gearbox, and exhaust system swaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual style:</strong> Create a unique look with dynamic vinyls and a variety of body parts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variety of game formats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/1122454e721c4b531d1de8400f03bde7.poster.avif?t=1786694345\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/1122454e721c4b531d1de8400f03bde7.webm?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/1122454e721c4b531d1de8400f03bde7.mp4?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers content for both single-player enthusiasts and multiplayer fans:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing mode:</strong> Try your hand at four official disciplines — <strong>Drag, Circuit racing, Drift</strong>, and <strong>Rally</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free activities:</strong> Head to the <strong>Drift</strong> and <strong>Time Attack</strong> tracks, available both in single-player for practice and in multiplayer to compete with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parking and driving challenges:</strong> Test your driving skills in 82 real-world parking and driving challenges. Challenges await you across a wide variety of vehicle classes — from classic and sports cars to pickups, tow trucks, and heavy trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-life simulator:</strong> Try on basic roles in the open world — work as a taxi driver or patrol the streets in police mode, issuing fines to other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for PC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/7117bbc705f3921963c5ec6d23b12826.poster.avif?t=1786694345\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/7117bbc705f3921963c5ec6d23b12826.webm?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/7117bbc705f3921963c5ec6d23b12826.mp4?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world comfortably with full support for PC peripherals: keyboard and mouse controls, gamepads, as well as <strong>racing wheels with Force Feedback</strong> for maximum car control. The game is adapted for a wide variety of display resolutions, including modern ultra-wide monitors.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/cbfb4c68eb9034f0b1ced8249a64b501.poster.avif?t=1786694345\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/cbfb4c68eb9034f0b1ced8249a64b501.webm?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/cbfb4c68eb9034f0b1ced8249a64b501.mp4?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Parking Multiplayer 2</strong> is the ultimate car sandbox and auto-life simulator, bringing together a massive car meet culture and legal motorsport. Explore a massive open world, customize cars beyond recognition, and compete with thousands of real players thanks to full crossplay support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features of the game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/661a7fabf77f19280d78b75a352101a0.poster.avif?t=1786694345\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252340/extras/661a7fabf77f19280d78b75a352101a0.webm?t=1786694345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati